sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Client
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as TrustyAI Operator<br/>8081/TCP Health, 8443/TCP Metrics
    participant TASCtrl as TrustyAIService Controller
    participant EHCtrl as EvalHub Controller
    participant LMCtrl as LMEvalJob Controller
    participant TASPod as TrustyAI Service Pod<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EvalJob as Eval Job Pod<br/>(lmes-driver + lmes-job)
    participant ModelEndpoint as Model Inference<br/>Endpoint
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService
    participant OTEL as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,TASPod: Flow 1: TrustyAIService Deployment
        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply TrustyAIService CR<br/>Bearer token auth
        K8sAPI->>TASCtrl: Watch notification<br/>ServiceAccount token
        TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment, Service, Route<br/>TLS 1.2+
        TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create PVC, Secrets, ServiceMonitor
        TASCtrl->>KServe: Watch InferenceServices<br/>correlate model state
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over User,KRBProxy: Flow 1b: TrustyAI Service Access
        User->>TASPod: POST /v1/info (via Route)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS re-encrypt
        TASPod->>KRBProxy: Forward to kube-rbac-proxy
        KRBProxy->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
        K8sAPI-->>KRBProxy: Authorized
        KRBProxy-->>TASPod: Upstream passthrough<br/>8081/TCP HTTP localhost
        TASPod-->>User: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over User,ModelEndpoint: Flow 2: LMEvalJob Execution
        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply LMEvalJob CR<br/>Bearer token auth
        K8sAPI->>LMCtrl: Watch notification
        LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create batch Job<br/>(lmes-driver + lmes-job containers)
        K8sAPI-->>EvalJob: Pod scheduled
        EvalJob->>ModelEndpoint: Inference requests<br/>HTTPS configurable auth
        ModelEndpoint-->>EvalJob: Model responses
        EvalJob->>K8sAPI: Update status (via driver)
        LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update LMEvalJob status
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over Operator,OTEL: Flow 3: EvalHub Multi-Tenant Setup
        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply EvalHub CR
        K8sAPI->>EHCtrl: Watch notification
        EHCtrl->>K8sAPI: List namespaces with tenant label
        EHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create SA, RBAC in tenant namespaces
        EHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Propagate ConfigMaps to tenants
        EHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Deploy EvalHub in control-plane namespace
    end

    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
        Note over Operator,OTEL: Observability
        Operator->>OTEL: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC configurable
    end
